OL,3,AArgentine couple to return Nazi-looted
OL,4,Apainting to rightful owner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA painting which was stolen by the
OL,7,FNazis and only recovered in Argentina
OL,8,Flast year must now be returned to the
OL,9,Fheir of its rightful owner, a court has
OL,10,Fruled.
OL,12,FThe late-baroque Portrait of a Lady was
OL,13,Flost for 80 years until it was spotted
OL,14,Fin photographs of a house for sale near
OL,15,FBuenos Aires.
