OL,3,AArgentine couple to return Nazi-looted
OL,4,Apainting to rightful owner
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe house belonged to Patricia Kadgien,
OL,7,Fthe daughter of a Nazi fugitive who had
OL,8,Ffled there after the Second World War,
OL,9,Fand she has now agreed to return the
OL,10,Fpainting in exchange for not being
OL,11,Fprosecuted for concealing it from the
OL,12,Fauthorities.
OL,14,FPortrait of a Lady was among over 1,000
OL,15,Fartworks looted from the collection of
OL,16,FJewish art dealer Jacques Goudstikker
OL,17,Fafter the Nazi invasion of the
OL,18,FNetherlands in 1940.
